# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Foodhut - ignore rules
#
# The guiding rule: a clone of this repository must be enough to run and deploy
# the site, and must never contain anything that should not be published.
# `public/dishes/` is therefore committed (the site cannot be deployed without
# it) while build output, caches and every form of local secret are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Dependencies and build output -----------------------------------------
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
build
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Environment / secrets --------------------------------------------------
# `.env.local` holds a real Firebase web config. `.env.example` is the
# documented template and IS committed, hence the negation below.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.local
!.env.example

# Service-account keys can create real Firebase Auth users and write any
# document, bypassing the security rules entirely. Never commit one.
service-account.json
*-service-account.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*.pem
*.key

# --- Firebase CLI -----------------------------------------------------------
# `.firebaserc` is committed on purpose: it pins the default project so a fresh
# clone deploys to the right place. The caches and debug logs below are not.
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
database-debug.log
pubsub-debug.log
.runtimeconfig.json
# firebase.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it carries the hosting rewrites,
# cache headers and security-rule paths, so a clone could not deploy without it.

# --- Test and tooling artefacts ---------------------------------------------
coverage
.nyc_output
.eslintcache
*.lcov

# Playwright CLI writes snapshots and ad-hoc screenshots per run.
.playwright-cli/
shots/

# `drop-photos/` holds a README explaining how to supply your own photography.
# The README is documentation and is committed; the images a developer drops in
# are working files that would bloat the repository and duplicate public/dishes/.
drop-photos/*
!drop-photos/README.md

# --- Editor and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
*.sw?
*.suo
*.user
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Logs -------------------------------------------------------------------
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
